 "stimulus_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"4\">\n  <li>Technology required. For each equation, find the exact solutions by completing the square and the approximate solutions by graphing. Then, verify that the solutions found using the two methods are close.</li>\n</ol>\n",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 668023,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>Solve the equation <span data-math=\"x^2+10x+8=0\">x^2+10x+8=0</span> by completing the square. <strong>Select two</strong> exact solutions.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li><span data-math=\"x= -5+ \\sqrt{17}\">x= -5+ \\sqrt{17}</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"x=5+ \\sqrt{17}\">x=5+ \\sqrt{17}</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"x=5- \\sqrt{17}\">x=5- \\sqrt{17}</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"x= -5- \\sqrt{17}\">x= -5- \\sqrt{17}</span></li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": []
  },
  {
   "id": 668024,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\" type=\"a\">\n    <li>Choose the graph that best represents the equation <span data-math=\"x^2+10x+8=0\">x^2+10x+8=0</span>.</li>\n  </ol>\n\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n  <p><strong>Graph A</strong><img alt=\"A downward-opening parabola is plotted on a grid, showing x-intercepts at (-0.745, 0) and (10.745, 0).\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"309\" src=\"exercises/media/8f931e907fbc05ce.jpg\" width=\"250\"></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Graph B</strong><img alt=\"A graph displays an orange parabola opening upwards, with its vertex positioned on the y-axis slightly above the x-axis. The coordinate plane has a grid, with the origin labeled '0', '50' on the y-axis, and '50' on the x-axis.\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"308\" src=\"exercises/media/2e613c01326be9f7.jpg\" width=\"250\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Graph C</strong><img alt=\"A graph shows a parabola with x-intercepts at (-11, 0) and the origin (0, 0). The curve opens upwards, extending into the first and second quadrants, with its vertex in the third.\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"324\" src=\"exercises/media/02d98e4dce6d29d0.jpg\" width=\"250\"></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Graph D</strong><img alt=\"A graph of an orange parabola on a Cartesian plane. The parabola opens upwards and intersects the x-axis at approximately (-9.123, 0) and (-0.877, 0). The y-axis and x-axis are labeled with values.\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"308\" src=\"exercises/media/a6fa26d941d0fccd.jpg\" width=\"250\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
   "answers": [
